      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed on this. A system to tag children with, which with a handful of tags will put a status on a child's account, and a Hide Children/Underage Players option in our game settings to disable seeing people/them see us with this tag would be lovely. A system in place to verify ages when tagged in case an adult accumulates them would be good too.",
